 "drawing": "3-section high тумба / display chest: two glazed side doors, centre = drawer over a solid door. No orthographic front view and no dimension lines (only a small perspective thumbnail at the top of p1, approx. pages/turin-0-26-p1.png 422,3,527,132, and the exploded view). Sides 2,3 and partitions 5,6 (1080x426) stand on bottom 4 (1500x446) — p2: parts 2,10,5,7,11,6,10,3 fixed to bottom 4 with Direkta 7x70; top 1 (1500x450) on sides/partitions with eccentrics. Inner widths from bars: 471 / 462 / 471 -> carcass 4x16+471+462+471 = 1468, top/bottom 1500 overhang ~16 mm per side. Bars 10 (471x70, side sections) and 11 (462x70, centre) sit on the bottom behind the doors (plinth rail). Centre: horizontal 7 (462x425) separates the drawer (front 12 = 476 wide x 251 high; sides 400x200, back 404x200, bottom 434x405 with no ДВП note) from the compartment below with 1 removable shelf 8 (460x416); centre door 18 = 820 high x 476 wide; 251+820 = 1071 vs 1074 side doors. Side sections: glazed doors 17 (1074 high x 476 wide, 2) and 2 glass shelves 9 (469x416) each on Secura supports; LED 4 clips + transformer. Plinth box 20/21 (1490x70) + 22 (368x70, 2), 5 levelling feet. Pilasters 19 (1080x22) on outer side front edges. Backs ДВП (note column empty but text says ДВП): 23 1103x493 (2) + 24 1103x476, scheme 23|24|23 (493+476+493 = 1462 vs 1468). Hinges: side doors inset K-16, 3 each (6); centre door half-overlay K-9.5 (2). Handles 4 (2 side doors + centre door + drawer). One drawer, 1 pair 400 mm guides. Height estimate (16 mm boards): 70+16+1080+16 = 1182."
